P_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Podium.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2202/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Podium.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2202/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Podium.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2202/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Podium.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2202/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Podium.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2202/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Podium.jpg","Eric Rea, Co-Founder & CEO of Podium","In recent years, we’ve seen a massive increase in e-commerce businesses, with industries like retail and electronics heavily impacted by online distribution channels. Yet a large segment of transactions—car repairs, home services, healthcare visits, and so on—can only be done in person. In fact, according to data from the U.S. Census Bureau, sales from offline retailers comprised 91% of total U.S. commerce in 2017. These offline establishments, however, have largely been left behind when it comes to the adoption of consumer-facing technology and software.\r\n\r\nPodium is bridging that gap by offering a communication and messaging system geared toward local businesses and their customers. The comprehensive SaaS platform helps businesses manage all communication, from reviews and website conversations to text marketing and payments. Now, brick and mortar businesses can communicate with customers the way customers prefer—using SMS, webchat, Facebook Messenger, Google and Apple business chat—all from one center of operations. As consumers move toward more convenient and often mobile-native modes of communication, Podium will continue to serve local businesses who need to adapt and meet their customers where they are.","Podium is a comprehensive communication platform helping local businesses connect with their customers using SMS, webchat, Facebook Messenger and more.","Podium - IVP Portfolio - Breakout Tech Venture Capital Funding","Podium - IVP Portfolio  ","The leading customer communication platform for local businesses",{"id":33,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":9,"assetUrlXs":9,"assetUrlSm":9,"assetUrlMd":9,"assetUrlLg":9,"assetUrlXl":9,"assetUrlXxl":9},"491","2018-01-01","https://careers.ivp.com/companydetail.php?cid=12657&v=32","Eric Rea","/content/podium-broadcasting-greatness/","Read the Funding Announcement","https://www.linkedin.com/company/podium/",{"id":41,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":42,"assetUrlXs":43,"assetUrlSm":44,"assetUrlMd":45,"assetUrlLg":46,"assetUrlXl":47,"assetUrlXxl":48},"493","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/493/Podium.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/493/xs_Podium.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/493/sm_Podium.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/493/md_Podium.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/493/lg_Podium.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/493/xl_Podium.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/493/xxl_Podium.jpg","Founded 2014\r\nPartnered 2018","Podium ","IVP has been an extremely supportive partner. They have a wealth of experience and understand what it takes to build a company of consequence. Their advice has had a strong influence on how I have thought about building out our team. Putting the right leaders in place can propel your company to a whole new level, and IVP’s investment and strategic advice have been instrumental in our growth.","podium",{"id":54,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":9,"assetUrlXs":9,"assetUrlSm":9,"assetUrlMd":9,"assetUrlLg":9,"assetUrlXl":9,"assetUrlXxl":9},"490",{"name":56,"slug":57},"Active","active",[59,62,65],{"fullName":60,"slug":61},"Eric Liaw","eric-liaw",{"fullName":63,"slug":64},"Sandy Miller","sandy-miller",{"fullName":66,"slug":67},"Tom Loverro","tom-loverro",{"id":69,"alt":8,"c